{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ordinal feature ordinal feature","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md","fileName":"Ordinal Feature.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ordinal Feature","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 01:05\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Feature Engineering Foundations]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Feature Engineering Foundations","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ordinal feature ordinal feature","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md","fileName":"Ordinal Feature.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ordinal Feature","heading":"Ordinal Feature","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An ordinal feature takes values from a set with a meaningful order but without guaranteed numerical spacing. Educational degrees can be ordered from bachelor to master to doctorate, yet the gaps between those levels are not measurable as equal quantities.\n\nAlgorithms may exploit the ranking while avoiding arithmetic interpretations that the scale does not support. Treating an ordinal variable as either unordered categories or fully quantitative values discards or invents structure.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Feature Engineering Foundations","featureengineeringformachinelearninganddataanalytics.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ordinal Feature.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ordinal feature ordinal feature","filePath":"6